	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'Bound was kneeling before'
	R
	'Rance.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Quite a beautiful castle...'
	R
	'Our hideout doesn’t come close'
	R
	'to comparing.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Then you guys should wear'
	R
	'better clothes. You should’ve'
	R
	'been provided uniforms.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Well... I think these clothes'
	R
	'are better for us. They suit'
	R
	'us more...'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'But if you tell us we must to'
	R
	'maintain order, then...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Nah, it’s fine.'
	R
	'You have to wash those clothes,'
	R
	'though.'
	R
	'They smell awful.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Okay.'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll go wash them, then.'
	R
	'Excuse me.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah.'
	\L_00f53:
