	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　Thieves’ Hideout'
	ZM 24:
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance went to his old hideout.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah... It’s cold here.'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'...Bound should be here, but...'
	R
	'Is he?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'...Doesn’t look like it...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'I see...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance... Sorry, if I had read'
	R
	'that letter sooner, then...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s fine, don’t worry about'
	R
	'it.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu... Hick...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey now, Soul?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'I wanna see him...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'I wanna see my brother...'
	R
	'Wah... Waaah...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Soul...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00ed6:
	ZH 1:
	'...Did someone call for me?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmm?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 3!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Boss!'
	R
	'And Soul, too!!'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 4!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Brother!!'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 484!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Boss?'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'Let me see.'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah, it really is the boss.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00ed6:
	ZH 1:
	'Many familiar faces appeared'
	R
	'from behind Bound.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 4!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Everyone... You’re alive,'
	R
	'you’re alive!!'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00ed6:
	ZH 1:
	'Soul ran to Bound.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Brother!!'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 3!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Owah!?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 4!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'I wanted to see you...'
	R
	'I wanted to see you so much!'
	R
	'Waah... Waaaaah...!!'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 3!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'I see... I wanted to see you'
	R
	'too, Soul.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00ed6:
	ZH 1:
	'Bound tousled his sister’s'
	R
	'hair as she cried into his'
	R
	'chest.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Guess you survived.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah... Somehow...'
	R
	'It’s been a while, B-...'
	R
	'King of Leazas, rather.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'So formal.'
	R
	'You should all call me Boss.'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'What’ve you been up to since'
	R
	'last I saw you?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'...Gathering my scattered'
	R
	'allies. They’re the important'
	R
	'subordinates that you'
	R
	'entrusted to me, after all.'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'Boss... We want to work under'
	R
	'you. Will you use us as'
	R
	'subordinates again?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Sure. You’re a filthy bunch,'
	R
	'but you can come to Leazas'
	R
	'Castle.'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'On the condition that you'
	R
	'bathe more often. I need to'
	R
	'keep my country of Leazas'
	R
	'refined. Gahahahaha.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'You got it, Boss.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 4!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Bound, I’m working under Rance'
	R
	'too. Let’s fight together.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 3!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, let’s both do our'
	R
	'best. Have you been behaving'
	R
	'yourself at the boss’s place?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 4!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah. Ms. Maris is teaching me'
	R
	'manners and how to write.'
	R
	'I have lots of fun every day.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	!VAR0516 : 3!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'I see...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, let’s go.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Okay!'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e66:
	ZH 1:
	'Thus, Bound Less joined the'
	R
	'Leazas Army.'
	\L_00f53:
