	\L_00e82:
	\L_00e66:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　Thieves’ Hideout'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　Rance’s Room'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance was waiting for Bound.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 3!
	\L_00ef2:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Sorry, Boss!'
	R
	'I was taking care of a bit of'
	R
	'business...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'If you’re a man you should’ve'
	R
	'known to get your business'
	R
	'done early.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'I was making dinner, though...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'What did you make?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'I made that tonkatsu and salad'
	R
	'you like.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'I see... Sounds good.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Well... What business do you'
	R
	'have with me, Boss?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Ooh, that’s right.'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhuhuhuhu, be thankful.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh??'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m giving you Starsha, one of'
	R
	'my women. I know you wanted'
	R
	'her.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh, really?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, I’m getting tired of her.'
	R
	'She hasn’t been crying'
	R
	'recently, it’s boring.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Thank you so much!'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'You happy?'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course!'
	R
	'She’s just my type.'
	R
	'I love that straight hair she'
	R
	'has...'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'But I gave up on her because'
	R
	'she was one of your women.'
	R
	'I thought it was love that'
	R
	'would never be...'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'But...'
	R
	'I’m glad.'
	R
	'Thank you so much!'
	R
	'I’ll treat her well!!'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e4a:
	ZH 1:
	'I didn’t want her anymore, but'
	R
	'if she makes another man this'
	R
	'happy, she’s too good for'
	R
	'him...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Actually, nevermind.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh!!??'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll play with her a bit more,'
	R
	'then I’ll give her to you.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah, man...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e2e:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s all I wanted with you.'
	R
	'Go away.'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00e9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah...'
	\L_00f53:
	ZH 1:
	'Okay...'
	\L_00f53:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00f00:
	\L_00ed6:
	ZH 1:
	'Bound clearly felt depressed'
	R
	'as he left the room.'
